\item OpenAI, \emph{A counterexample to integer-degree harmonic dimension comparison}, 2026-09-25; citation key \texttt{OAI:A-counterexample-to-integer-degree-harmonic-dimension-comparison-September-25-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-counterexample-to-integer-degree-harmonic-dimension-comparison-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-counterexample-to-integer-degree-harmonic-dimension-comparison-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-counterexample-to-integer-degree-harmonic-dimension-comparison-September-25-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/A-counterexample-to-integer-degree-harmonic-dimension-comparison-September-25-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/A-counterexample-to-integer-degree-harmonic-dimension-comparison-September-25-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex\#L23}{thm:main}.
\item Family 361: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/361.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/HarmonicGrowth.json}{Comparator HarmonicGrowth.json}.
